###############################################################################
# AI / LLM
###############################################################################

# Anchored: an unanchored `models/` also matched `docs/modules/models/`, so a
# real documentation directory was invisible to git and missing from every fresh
# clone and worktree -- `check_docs` and the doc-link test failed there while
# passing in the author's checkout. `!app/models/` was masking the same
# collision for the Python package. Weights only ever live at the repo root.
/models/
!app/models/
checkpoints/
weights/

*.gguf
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx

